<Project>

	<!-- Deliberately empty, and deliberately here. It stops the repository's own
	     Directory.Build.props from reaching this project: what is being tested is
	     whether the package works in somebody else's build, and somebody else does not
	     have `LangVersion latest`, `Nullable enable` or anything else set here. The
	     same reasoning stops Directory.Packages.props beside it — a stranger names a
	     version on the reference, which is also how this one pins what it just built. -->

</Project>
